{"id":"n18761-1-7","stage":5,"title":"고아 · 孤儿","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n18761-1-7-1","ko":"저는 교통사고로 어렸을 때 부모님을 잃었어요.","zh":"我小时候因为交通事故失去了父母。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저는","audio":"/audio/0b05af6c0b14d6e70820.mp3"}},{"text":"교통사고로","meaning":"交通事故","explanation":"교통사고：交通事故；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"교통사고","audio":"/audio/28bb225f685ceba3c5b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"35968","senseId":"1","lemma":"교통사고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"교통사고로","audio":"/audio/e4750760b0f99e33cb56.mp3"}},{"text":"어렸을","meaning":"年幼、年龄小","explanation":"어리다：年幼、年龄小；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"어리다","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74176","senseId":"1","lemma":"어리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어렸을","audio":"/audio/314f3a56783f02be9cd3.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"부모님을","meaning":"父母","explanation":"부모님：父母；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"부모님","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62272","senseId":"1","lemma":"부모님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부모님을","audio":"/audio/4c17df675b39f2e85296.mp3"}},{"text":"잃었어요.","meaning":"失去","explanation":"잃다：失去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"잃다","audio":"/audio/03ebbd29f2834d52089e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17177","senseId":"3","lemma":"잃다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잃었어요","audio":"/audio/f67991ff4435c73ba0dd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"28bb225f685ceba3","term":"교통사고","zh":"交通事故","audio":"/audio/28bb225f685ceba3c5b7.mp3","entryId":"35968","definition":"汽车或火车等与其他交通工具相撞或撞到人的事故。","pronunciation":["교통사고"]},{"id":"ec54bee5939613d4","term":"어리다","zh":"年幼、年龄小","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3","entryId":"74176","definition":"年纪小。","pronunciation":["어리다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"068bccdcf866defe","term":"부모님","zh":"父母","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3","entryId":"62272","definition":"(敬语)父亲和母亲。","pronunciation":["부모님"]},{"id":"03ebbd29f2834d52","term":"잃다","zh":"失去","audio":"/audio/03ebbd29f2834d52089e.mp3","entryId":"17177","definition":"亲人死亡而与之分离。","pronunciation":["일타"]}],"audio":"/audio/1d6ddd8bd0b85bf9f2d5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n18761-1-7-2","ko":"고아로 자랐는데도 참 반듯하게 잘 컸구나.","zh":"虽然是在孤儿环境中长大的，但你却长得这么优秀啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"고아로","meaning":"孤儿","explanation":"고아：孤儿；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"고아","audio":"/audio/0c1add56d2eadc7881b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18761","senseId":"1","lemma":"고아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고아로","audio":"/audio/35ee3c3b08903146ca1e.mp3"}},{"text":"자랐는데도","meaning":"生长，成长","explanation":"자라다：生长，成长；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데도：表示与预期相反的结果：“虽然……却……”。","readings":[{"term":"자라다","audio":"/audio/17c36cbe99642c8ec84b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66317","senseId":"2","lemma":"자라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자랐는데도","audio":"/audio/541370dff219922e51d2.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"반듯하게","meaning":"端正，整齐","explanation":"반듯하다：端正，整齐；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"반듯하다","audio":"/audio/1e300d2d21deaae744f9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56877","senseId":"1","lemma":"반듯하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반듯하게","audio":"/audio/7d58c9da2bf36ed0f803.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，了不起地","explanation":"잘：很好地，了不起地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"8","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"컸구나.","meaning":"成长","explanation":"크다：成长；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66584","senseId":"2","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"컸구나","audio":"/audio/db0b92fc2421e9b82ca8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0c1add56d2eadc78","term":"고아","zh":"孤儿","audio":"/audio/0c1add56d2eadc7881b8.mp3","entryId":"18761","definition":"父母双亡或被父母抛弃而没有父母的孩子。","pronunciation":["고아"]},{"id":"17c36cbe99642c8e","term":"자라다","zh":"生长，成长","audio":"/audio/17c36cbe99642c8ec84b.mp3","entryId":"66317","definition":"在某种环境过背景下长大。","pronunciation":["자라다"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"1e300d2d21deaae7","term":"반듯하다","zh":"端正，整齐","audio":"/audio/1e300d2d21deaae744f9.mp3","entryId":"56877","definition":"正而不歪斜或弯曲，也不散乱。","pronunciation":["반드타다"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，了不起地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"非常好地、优秀地，值得称赞地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"成长","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66584","definition":"长大成人。","pronunciation":["크다"]}],"audio":"/audio/470b8642d807f171d8ba.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.262,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=18761","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":156,"sequenceScore":3.0887,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["虽然是在孤儿环境中长大的，但你却长得这么优秀啊。","我小时候因为交通事故失去了父母。","这道题要怎么解啊？太难了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我小时候因为交通事故失去了父母。","这道题要怎么解啊？太难了。","虽然是在孤儿环境中长大的，但你却长得这么优秀啊。"],"answer":2}]}
